   "id": 372514,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>WorldCorp is releasing a new universal remote control model that has a touch screen and is programmable for any model of TV, stereo, cable box, and movie player. The sales figures for the preorders need to be added together by location and then multiplied by the price per unit to get the final sales figures. Enter the data into Sheets and complete the table using functions.</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"exercises/media/25f66129c90f0da2.jpg\" alt=\"Item Description - Digital touch screen remote control. Row 4 headings: Date, Location X, Location Y, Location Z. Row 5: 5/24/2021, 424, 986, 883. Row 6 lists: 17/2021, 864, 332, 554. Row 7: 2/19/2021, 429, 446, 473. Row 8: Total Sales – blank. Row 9: Price per Unit – 76.88 in all. Row 10: Revenue – blank. \">",
